  "comparability_notes": [
    "Consolidated US GAAP, calendar fiscal years; historical DVD business included through its September 2023 closure.",
    "DVD cash purchases/amortization separately shown through 2018, then no longer separately disclosed; streaming/content rows are consistently the large streaming investment, not total historical investment.",
    "2019 lease accounting adoption creates a lease balance-sheet comparability break; absent earlier lease balance entries remain null.",
    "2020 pandemic and 2023 strikes affect cash content production timing; single-year CFO is not normalized recurring earning power.",
    "November 14, 2025 ten-for-one split: original share data filed before split multiplied by ten. Later already-adjusted data are never multiplied again.",
    "Cash income taxes may move from IncomeTaxesPaid to IncomeTaxesPaidNet under 2025 disclosure changes; tag provenance retained.",
    "CFO less PPE is a calculated cash metric, not issuer-defined historical FCF, not FCFF and not acquisition-inclusive total-investment cash flow. Historical issuer FCF also deducted other investing assets, and older periods DVD content purchases. For example FY2021 CFO less PPE is -131.975m versus issuer FCF -158.894m after 26.919m other investing assets. SBC-cash-replacement subtraction is a policy proxy, not reported cash."
  ]
}
